# TMDB API

- Never call TMDB from the public landing (`components/home/**`). Use static assets in `public/`.
- `TMDB_API_TOKEN` stays server-side only (`lib/tmdb/**`, `app/api/tmdb/**`).
- Prefer find-by-`imdb_id` and batched enrichment over N title searches.
- Use `useQuery` with long `staleTime` and stable keys; cache route handlers where appropriate.
- Deduplicate `imdb_id` before enrichment jobs.
